/Title (The inaugural session of ICDC'26 - "Digital Futures: Reimagining Social and Business Models' was successfullv conducted at Seminar Complex, CUSAT on 15th May. The session commenced with a warm welcome address by Dr. Devi Soumyaja, Assistant Professor & Research Coordinator, SMS, CUSAT followed bv an introduction to the conference and the activities of the SMS Research Forum by Ms. Lakshmi G, Research Scholar & Coordinator, SMS Research Forum. The presidential address was delivered by Prof.\(Dr.\) Sam Thomas, Director, SMS, CUSAT. The conference was formally inaugurated by Prof. \(Dr.\) M. Junaid Bushiri, Hon' Vice Chancellor, CUSAT. The keynote address by Prof. \(Dr.\) Saji Gopinath, Hon' Vice Chancellor, Digital University Kerala, offered valuable insights into the evolving landscape of digital futures and research.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 544 0 R
/Next 595 0 R
>>
endobj
