/Title (The SMS Research Forum at the School of Management Studies \(SMS\), Cochin University of Science and Technology \(CUSAT\), was established to foster a vibrant culture of quality, innovation, and solution-oriented research. Inaugurated on 4 January 2025, the Forum serves as a collaborative platform that encourages meaningful research, academic excellence, interdisciplinary engagement, and stronger connections between academia and industry. Through research initiatives, scholarly discussions, workshops, and collaborations, the Forum aims to inspire researchers and students to address contemporary societal and managerial challenges while advancing the research ecosystem at SMS, CUSAT.)
